 "description": "<p>Arctic DTU Sisimiut - Ilinniarfeqarfik Sisimiut is a technical campus in Sisimiut operated by the <a href=\"https://www.dtu.dk/\">Technical University of Denmark</a> in close cooperation with the Government of Greenland and <a href=\"https://www.kti.gl/kl/\">KTI</a>, the technical vocational school of Greenland. The campus conducts education in arctic engineering and research and innovation projects in Arctic technology. The campus and its activities are anchored both in Greenland and in Denmark at DTU. The activities take place in close collaboration with the Greenlandic society, local Greenlandic authorities and industries. Building and the extended technical infrastructure at Arctic DTU - Ilinniarfeqarfik Sisimiut are provided by Arctic DTU and KTI in&nbsp; collaboration. The facilities included teaching rooms and offices, laboratories, workshops, field equipment, storage rooms, dorms and vacant housing which may be rented by external research instituation a daily basis during low season periods.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
